    "body": "Stopped before claiming #1861 because its required dependency #1860 is unavailable on an allowed base.\nUpstream main 6f8b309dcea9ea2c367ecfa53261ed140881bab3 has no crates/geometry/src/dxf module or the normalized DXF primitives requested here.\n#1860 is still open. Its latest comment reports uncommitted work in .claude/worktrees/issue-1860, with no push or PR.\nThe open-PR search found no #1860 PR to stack on.\nThe prospective sketch-chaining files have no open-PR overlap.\nNo claim, branch, code change, test, or gate run was made for #1861.\nThe next attempt needs #1860 on upstream/main or in an eligible open PR that it can stack on.\n",
